This example statically links the exact tokei crate version declared in Cargo.toml, the public
SuperExplorer SDK API crates, serde, serde_json, and their exact transitive
Cargo.lock closure. It never downloads a dependency or launches tokei.exe at
runtime. See SBOM.json, LICENSES.json, provenance.json, and Cargo.lock for the
machine-readable linkage, license, source, and reproducibility inventory.
